@startuml
' Interim sequence diagram for using an item, drawn before implementation began.
actor Person
participant GameScreen
participant Player
participant Item
participant Inventory
participant HUD

Person -> GameScreen: press key
GameScreen -> Player: useItem()
Player -> Inventory: getSelected()
Inventory --> Player: selected item
Player -> Item: use()
Item --> Player: effect done
Player -> Inventory: remove(item)
Inventory -> HUD: incrementCount()
@enduml
